=== Strategy ===
If you can fight a [[Badger]] or [[Wolverine]] you can comfortably fight Royal Guard Ants, but keep in mind they have access to some fairly powerful moves like Dark Heart, Unstoppable and Shredding Paw. Just don't let them outnumber you and use Quick Barrage or Sideswipe and Full Circle.

